@startuml
title Shenandoah 单轮 GC 状态机（完整阶段）
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide empty description
state "Concurrent Reset\n（并发：复位位图、捕获 TAMS）" as RESET
state "Pause Init Mark\n（STW：扫根、开启 SATB）" as IM
state "Concurrent Marking\n（并发：遍历 + 排空 SATB）" as CM
state "Pause Final Mark\n（STW：终止、弱引用、选 CSet）" as FM
state "Concurrent Cleanup\n（并发：回收立即垃圾）" as CL1
state "Concurrent Evacuation\n（并发：搬 CSet 活对象）" as EV
state "Pause Init Update Refs\n（STW：停止疏散、准备扫描）" as IUR
state "Concurrent Update Refs\n（并发：线性扫堆改引用）" as CUR
state "Pause Final Update Refs\n（STW：更新剩余根、收尾）" as FUR
state "Concurrent Cleanup\n（并发：整体回收 CSet region）" as CL2
state "Degenerated GC\n（STW：从退化点继续）" as DEG
state "Full GC\n（STW：整堆 mark-compact）" as FULL
[*] --> RESET
RESET --> IM
IM --> CM
CM --> FM
FM --> CL1
CL1 --> EV : CSet 非空
CL1 --> IM : CSet 为空（短路，直接下一轮）
EV --> IUR
IUR --> CUR
CUR --> FUR
FUR --> CL2
CL2 --> IM : 下一轮
CM -[#red]-> DEG : 分配失败/取消
FM -[#red]-> DEG : 分配失败/取消
EV -[#red]-> DEG : 分配失败/取消
CUR -[#red]-> DEG : 分配失败/取消
DEG -[#red]-> FULL : 连续多次退化无进展\n(ShenandoahFullGCThreshold=3)
FULL --> IM
note right of DEG
  退化点（degen point）：
  outside_cycle / roots / mark /
  evac / updaterefs
  从断点处改为 STW 继续，而不是从头再来
end note
note bottom of FULL
  仅作最后兜底：整堆压实，停顿与堆大小相关；
  正常调优目标是让 Full GC 不发生
end note
@enduml
